 "notes": [
  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120, round 5): the SE front (surface 25, 43.8 m) from w02-140s1 (2024) and w02-140s2 (2025): a tall grey ground storey (1.45 of an upper storey, a grey paint plinth) with six framed glazed entrances and shop windows (wallLights), four storeys of red-brown metal tiles (drawn as the wall colour) with small window groups, and the white cut-out 57 at the left corner (signage.up). The NE and SW flanks (w04-51, w05-230, 2021/2025, behind trees) are beige and nearly blank. The NW and the upper volumes take the red tile scheme.",
  "Not drawn: the irregular window groups (the kit draws a regular grid of small windows), the yellow-soffit loggia band on the first floor, the sculptural depth of the 57."
 ]
